---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ label: 'Wholesale & Distribution', href: '/wholesale/' }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wholesale & Distributor Cooperation"
  description="Wholesale buying and distributor cooperation for automotive filters — bulk pricing, MOQ, lead time and distributor terms."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:2rem;max-width:820px;">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Wholesale &amp; Distribution</nav>
    <h1>Wholesale &amp; distributor cooperation</h1>

    <p class="lede" style="max-width:70ch;">
      For buyers ordering automotive filters in bulk, or distributors looking to carry a filter
      line under their own supply agreement, wholesale terms cover pricing, MOQ, lead time and
      packaging across the automotive range.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Who wholesale is for</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="data">
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Buyer type</th><th scope="col">What they typically need</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Parts distributors</strong></td><td>Multi-SKU replenishment across engine intake, cabin, oil, fuel, hydraulic and transmission lines.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Fleet and workshop supply</strong></td><td>High-volume repeats on a narrow set of OE references, with consistent packaging.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Regional wholesalers</strong></td><td>Bulk orders by container with neutral or own-brand packaging.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Wholesale terms</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="data">
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Term</th><th scope="col">How it is set</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>MOQ</strong></td><td>Quoted per line. Standard catalogue sizes carry lower minimums; custom sizes and dedicated OE matches carry higher minimums.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Pricing</strong></td><td>Per-line, tiered by quantity. Indicative pricing is confirmed on quotation.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Lead time</strong></td><td>Standard sizes ship faster; custom sizes and private-label packaging add lead time.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Plain carton, retail box, polybag or custom-printed packaging.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Distributor cooperation</h2>
      <p>
        Distributor cooperation is arranged around a defined SKU range and a target market. The
        scope of the range, any exclusivity terms, pricing tier and packaging are agreed per
        agreement — they are not published as a fixed schedule. A first article is approved before
        serial production, and the approved sample is kept as the reference for every subsequent
        batch.
      </p>
      <p class="notice" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        Scope boundary: wholesale and distributor cooperation is offered for automotive filters,
        which are the manufacturing range of Qinghe Huiying. Industrial, HVAC, HEPA/ULPA and
        liquid products catalogued on this platform are not Huiying-manufactured.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Start a wholesale inquiry</h2>
      <p>
        State the SKU range or OE numbers, the target quantity per line, and the destination
        market. We respond with an MOQ, lead-time and price indication per line.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/rfq/">Submit an RFQ →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/oem/" style="margin-left:0.5rem;">OEM / private label</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/" style="margin-left:0.5rem;">Contact</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
